 Emails are not delivered yet: `sendEmail` in `src/lib/email.ts` keeps them in `outbox`.
+
+## Errors
+
+Errors the API expects, such as bad input, a missing sign-in or something not found, come back as JSON, `{ "error": "<message>" }`, with a 4xx status. Signed-in routes answer 401 without a valid token, and admin routes answer 403 to customers.
+
+An order can have at most 100 of one product; `POST /api/orders` refuses a larger `quantity` with 400.
